title    Aurora
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Antarctica option "aurora": cold and wide in D minor at 134. Vibraphone carries the hook over a pizzicato ostinato and a sustained choir, with timpani and a triangle on a hard four-on-the-floor. The last eight bars lift a tone. Layers: pizzicato, choir and FM bass, then kick, snare, timpani and triangle at 2x, the vibraphone at 3x, a bell double and straight hats at FRENZY.
tempo    134
beats    4
steps    2
reverb   0.4

# untagged voices are the base layer; the intro plays every layer
voice pizz   pizz      vol=0.3  pan=0.35
voice choir  voices    vol=0.24 pan=-0.25 center=D4
voice bass   fmbass    vol=0.7  gate=0.75
voice kick   bigkick   vol=0.64 layer=drums
voice snare  snare     vol=0.58 pan=0.05 layer=drums
voice timp   timpani   vol=0.5  pan=-0.1 layer=drums
voice tri    tri       vol=0.22 pan=0.5 layer=drums
voice crash  crash     vol=0.3  pan=-0.2 layer=drums
voice vibes  vibes     vol=0.78 pan=0.05 layer=lead
voice bell   bell      vol=0.4  pan=-0.35 layer=frenzy
voice hat    hat909    vol=0.3  pan=0.4 layer=frenzy

pattern intro
choir | [Dm]------- | [A]------- |
vibes | . . . . A4 D5 F5 A5 | C#6--- E5--- |
timp  | D2------- | A2- A2- A2 A2 A2 A2 |

pattern A
vibes | A5- F5 D5 A5- G5 F5 | Bb5- A5 F5 D5- C5 D5 | E5- G5 C6 Bb5- A5 G5 | A5--- C#5- E5- |
pizz  | D4 A4 F4 A4 D4 A4 F4 A4 | D4 Bb4 F4 Bb4 D4 Bb4 F4 Bb4 | E4 C5 G4 C5 E4 C5 G4 C5 | E4 C#5 A4 C#5 E4 C#5 A4 C#5 |
choir | [Dm]------- | [Bb]------- | [C]------- | [A]------- |
bass  | D2- D2- D2- D3- | Bb2- Bb2- Bb2- F2- | C3- C3- C3- G2- | A2- A2- A2- E2- |
kick  | x.x.x.x. | % | % | % |
snare | ..x...x. | % | % | ..x..xxx |
timp  | D2--- .--- | Bb2--- .--- | C3--- .--- | A2--- A2- A2 A2 |
tri   | .x.x.x.x | % | % | % |
crash | X....... | _ | _ | _ |
bell  | A5- F5 D5 A5- G5 F5 | Bb5- A5 F5 D5- C5 D5 | E5- G5 C6 Bb5- A5 G5 | A5--- C#5- E5- |
hat   | xxxxxxxx | % | % | % |

pattern A2 from A
vibes | A5- F5 D5 A5- G5 F5 | Bb5- A5 F5 D5- C5 D5 | E5- G5 C6 D6- C6 Bb5 | C#6--- A5- E5- |
bell  | A5- F5 D5 A5- G5 F5 | Bb5- A5 F5 D5- C5 D5 | E5- G5 C6 D6- C6 Bb5 | C#6--- A5- E5- |
crash | _ | _ | _ | _ |

pattern B from A
vibes | D6--- Bb5--- | A5--- F5--- | F5- G5 A5 Bb5- C6 D6 | C#6--- E5--- |
bell  | D6--- Bb5--- | A5--- F5--- | F5- G5 A5 Bb5- C6 D6 | C#6--- E5--- |
pizz  | D4 Bb4 G4 Bb4 D4 Bb4 G4 Bb4 | D4 A4 F4 A4 D4 A4 F4 A4 | D4 Bb4 F4 Bb4 D4 Bb4 F4 Bb4 | E4 C#5 G4 C#5 E4 C#5 G4 C#5 |
choir | [Gm]------- | [Dm]------- | [Bb]------- | [A7]------- |
bass  | G2- G2- G2- D2- | D2- D2- D2- A2- | Bb2- Bb2- Bb2- F2- | A2- A2- A2- E2- |
timp  | G2--- .--- | D2--- .--- | Bb2--- .--- | A2--- A2- A2 A2 |
crash | X....... | _ | _ | _ |

pattern B2 from B
vibes | D6--- Bb5--- | A5--- F5--- | F5- G5 A5 Bb5- C6 D6 | E6- C#6 A5 E5- C#5 E5 |
bell  | D6--- Bb5--- | A5--- F5--- | F5- G5 A5 Bb5- C6 D6 | E6- C#6 A5 E5- C#5 E5 |
snare | ..x...x. | % | % | x.x.XXXX |

play intro
loop A A2 B B2 A A2 A+2 A2+2
